- anytype-heart protobuf and JSON assets for the paired middleware version,
  downloaded by anytype-ts's own update.sh during the build.
- Playwright and its Chromium build (Apache License 2.0), through the
  mcr.microsoft.com/playwright base image and the playwright npm package.
